/-!
# Entire original initial relations in the actual central deformation saturation

Only the original coherent ideal sheaf and the actual dimensions are original
consumer inputs. Its entire origin ideal is constructed from actual stalk
members, with a true whole representative dictionary. The actual polynomial
scaling (x,y,u,v) ↦ (x,u*v), doubled whole Hadamard decomposition, genuine
parameter-power ideal membership and whole integral-domain cancellation supply
its exact central original initial symbol. Actual original sheaf pullback and
the internally selected SAME parameter saturation index place EVERY original
initial relation in the actual central ideal. True generation by ALL original
relations then gives the ENTIRE analytic-extension ideal inclusion.

The reverse whole analytic central ideal inclusion, nearby ORIGINAL Rees/cone
dictionaries, nearby all-degree freeness, analytic normal-flat loci, higher HS
and G8 remain OPEN. No original-stalk-to-nearby-stalk map is invented.
Mathematics was written first in the own Blueprint.tex. This own offlib draft
awaits formal write-set registration and its native target build.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
